WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.613
Describe responsible citizenship and community service

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:09.331
Citizenship: membership in a country with rights and responsibilities. Good manners:

00:00:09.331 --> 00:00:11.106
polite and thoughtful conduct.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.535
Patriotism: caring about the well-being of your country. Peaceful living: respecting

00:00:16.535 --> 00:00:21.537
others and resolving problems without violence. Volunteer: a person who freely gives

00:00:21.537 --> 00:00:22.787
time to help.

00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:28.075
Write a pledge with three realistic actions you can take as a responsible learner.
